@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 304(a) of the Penal Code 1871
GIVEN f IS A `Homicide Facts` @desc What the accused did, what he meant or knew, and the Exceptions
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 304(a)` f IF
        "Whoever commits"
    AND `commits culpable homicide not amounting to murder` f
    AND "(a) if the act by which death is caused is done"
    AND (    f's `with the intention of causing death`
         OR  f's `with the intention of causing such bodily injury as is likely to cause death` )

@export Whether the accused has committed an offence punishable under section 304(b) of the Penal Code 1871
GIVEN f IS A `Homicide Facts` @desc What the accused did, what he meant or knew, and the Exceptions
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 304(b)` f IF
        "Whoever commits"
    AND `commits culpable homicide not amounting to murder` f
    AND "(b) if the act is done"
    AND f's `with the knowledge that he is likely by such act to cause death`
    AND "but without any intention to cause death, or to cause such bodily injury as is likely to cause death"
    AND NOT (f's `with the intention of causing death`)
    AND NOT (f's `with the intention of causing such bodily injury as is likely to cause death`)

GIVEN f IS A `Homicide Facts`
GIVETH A LIST OF STRING
`elements of culpable homicide not amounting to murder not made out` f MEANS
    concat (LIST
        (`elements of culpable homicide not made out` f),
        (`missing unless` (NOT (`commits murder` f)) "not amounting to murder (the facts make out murder under section 300 with no Exception: charge under section 302)"))

@export Frame a charge under section 304(a) of the Penal Code 1871, or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Homicide Facts` @desc What the accused did, and the particulars of the charge
