GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `offence under s 308B` f IF
        "A person shall be guilty of an offence who"
    AND f's `intentionally or knowingly conceals, desecrates or disposes of a human corpse`
    AND "and by such act impedes or prevents -"
    AND (    f's `by such act impedes or prevents the discovery or identification of a human corpse`
         OR  f's `by such act impedes or prevents the detection, investigation or prosecution of an offence` )

@export Frame a charge under section 308B of the Penal Code 1871, or say why none can be framed
GIVEN f IS A `Corpse Facts` @desc The facts, and the particulars of the charge
GIVETH A Charge
`charge under s 308B` f MEANS
    `frame the charge` (f's particulars) "308B(2)" "concealment, desecration or disposal of corpse"
        (`punishment prescribed by s 308B(2)`'s words)
        (`offence under s 308B` f)
        (CONCAT "did intentionally conceal, desecrate or dispose of ", f's `the corpse`, ", and by such act impeded ",
                `joined with` " and " (concat (LIST
                    (`included if` (f's `by such act impedes or prevents the discovery or identification of a human corpse`) "the discovery or identification of a human corpse"),
                    (`included if` (f's `by such act impedes or prevents the detection, investigation or prosecution of an offence`) "the detection, investigation or prosecution of an offence"))),
                ", to wit, ", f's `the manner`)
        (concat (LIST (`missing unless` (f's `intentionally or knowingly conceals, desecrates or disposes of a human corpse`) "intentionally or knowingly conceals, desecrates or disposes of a human corpse"),
                      (`missing unless` (f's `by such act impedes or prevents the discovery or identification of a human corpse` OR f's `by such act impedes or prevents the detection, investigation or prosecution of an offence`) "by such act impedes or prevents the discovery or identification of a corpse, or the detection, investigation or prosecution of an offence")))

